WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:04,780
Did you see this? This is where the owners of the community live.

2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:09,820
This side is hole A, that side is hole B

3
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,820
There are actually human guests in the community.

4
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:12,820
It's really strange

5
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,820
Are they here for a tour?

6
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:26,470
Several guests, you are coming to visit our community.

7
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:29,920
It's very dangerous in this neighborhood.

8
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:31,920
If you're not careful, you may get injured.

9
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:32,920
I am a third-S level weirdo

10
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,920
Let me show you around the community

11
00:00:34,920 --> 00:00:36,920
Nothing will go wrong

12
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,920
How about hiring me as a tour guide?
